Jetson-specific patch to jetson-ffmpeg (github.com/gjrtimmer/jetson-ffmpeg) at 8d70c17, for libnvmpi and its
FFmpeg wrapper (ffmpeg/dev/common/libavcodec/nvmpi_dec.c). Applied by scripts/build_gozen.sh and
scripts/install/install_jetson_hwdec.sh (git apply ignores this text).

Platform: tested on Jetson AGX Orin (t234), L4T R36.4.3 / JetPack 6.2, Ubuntu 22.04.
          Jetson Xavier NX / AGX Xavier (t194, L4T R35, JetPack 5): not tested yet.

- nvmpi_dec.c: a flush closes the decoder and the next packet creates a new one (in-place reset hangs on R36).
- libnvmpi: close() in ~55 ms instead of ~1 s, and no crash when closed mid-stream.
- libnvmpi: decoders are set up and torn down one at a time, and a decoder whose capture thread stops on an
  error fails its packets instead of blocking forever (game froze with three screens switching videos).
Upstream reports: docs/upstream_issues/.

