+	//Close the decoder and create a new one with the next packet (in
+	//nvmpi_decode), rather than nvmpi_decoder_flush(): after that in-place
+	//reset (STREAMOFF/ON) the V4L2 decoder sends no new resolution-change
+	//event for the same stream, at least on JetPack 6 (L4T R36.4), so the
+	//capture plane never restarts and the next put_packet blocks forever in
